# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — aarch64 默认 unsigned char 导致 C++ 模板部分特化歧义 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-03
# Software: jsonifier 0.9.97
# Gate: conan create / 消费者编译（OHOS aarch64）
# Status: UNMATCHED — 相关 E419（plain char signedness）但为 C 语言/-fsigned-char 层面，待 promote
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-jsonifier-char-traits-partial-spec-ambiguity
severity: 2
category: platform, portability
trigger_tool: clang|clang++
phase: compilation
approach: 在 uint8_type 概念的模板部分特化上追加
  `requires (!std::same_as<unwrap_t<T>, char>)` 排除纯 char；不改类型语义，
  仅消除与 not_uint8_t 特化的歧义

keywords: char_traits, partial specialization, ambiguous, unsigned char, aarch64, uint8_type, same_as

error_signature: ambiguous partial specializations of 'char_traits<const char>|ambiguous partial specializations of .*char_traits.*char>
match_keywords: char_traits,ambiguous partial specializations,const char,unsigned char,aarch64

root_cause: aarch64（OHOS）默认 plain char 为 unsigned，模板概念 `uint8_type`
  （sizeof==1 && unsigned_integral）对纯 char 成立；库中同时存在按 not_uint8_t 与
  uint8_type 分派的 char_traits 部分特化时，char 同时满足两个约束 → 歧义
  （x86 上 char 为 signed，不触发）
affected_scope: 任意 C++ 库以 char/uint8_t 语义分派模板部分特化（char_traits 等）
  且目标平台默认 char 为 unsigned；jsonifier 0.9.97 适配实测（E419 为 C 语言
  INT8 API 层面，未覆盖 C++ 模板特化歧义，属新增差异）

prescan_pattern: template<jsonifier::concepts::uint8_type|char_traits<|not_uint8_t|uint8_type
prescan_globs: "*.h, *.hpp, *.c, *.cc, *.cpp"